Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighteenth Episode\NThe Magic Mirror\NMysterious Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Princess Bella. We will be in Silverland soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate real food! Fruit juice is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, won't you eat at least a little bit of something else—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say I don't want it, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to turn me into a fat, hideous maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no, of course not... Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the most beautiful woman in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.44,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O, kotaeyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.44,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hark, I shall answer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.52,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yoku kikuga yoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.52,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Listen carefully.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:29.84,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sekaiju no koto wa shiranaiga,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:29.84,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know not of the whole world,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:33.38,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kono kuni de ichiban utsukushi no wa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:33.38,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the most beautiful in this land...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:34.84,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:37.44,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}omaeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:37.44,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}well, that would be you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, there's no girl prettier than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm traveling around the world to make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,11 of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes, yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, how's that? That makes 12!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, how frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Blech!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I won't yield!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, you made me play this game hoping I'd break my neck, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommended it because it's a manly sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then since I won, that makes me a manly man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, yes, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A manly man...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that seems a bit problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a deluxe carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it has a kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is no one here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But what an incredible carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a Rolls-Royce!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there someone further inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop, the flowers we picked are to make perfume, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, don't do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww, what a dirty kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to see such a dirty kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the most beautiful in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.80,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kotaeyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.80,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.21,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sekaiju no koto wa shiranaiga
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.21,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know about the rest of the world, {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:19.41,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kono Silverland de ichiban utsukushi no wa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:19.41,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the most beautiful in Silverland is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:20.86,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.04,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ima made kayottekita dono kuni ni mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.04,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In every land we've visited,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:29.77,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella, omae yori utsukushi musume hainakatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:29.77,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella, no maiden was more beautiful than you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:34.28,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shikashi kono Silverland ni wa Sapphire toiu utsukushi hime ga iru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:34.28,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But here in Silverland, there is a beautiful princess named Sapphire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:35.94,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire wa Bella yori utsukushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:35.94,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire is more beautiful than Bella.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she, this maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never let anyone find out that you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of these troublesome laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to raise her to be a fine woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an ancient law of this kingdom. If broken, the people won't forgive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, where is this girl named Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is the princess of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sapphire is a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a strong prince, definitely not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my mirror told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Sapphire is a maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And a girl prettier than me, no less!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic mirror told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what incredible luck! A total windfall! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, take me to Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be satisfied until I see for myself which of us is more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, this has turned into quite an interesting situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tear off Sapphire's mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My, if it isn't yesterday's thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But, well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow... that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as weak as a woman, Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I yield...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Face up or face down? Which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Face up or face down? Face up...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look me in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're really beautiful. Man, you drive me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... are you really a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why a gorgeous girl like you drives me wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Sapphire is just a filthy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way a girl prettier than me exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror, answer without teasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the prettiest of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:21.58,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sore wa Sapphire da.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:21.58,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That would be Sapphire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still teasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:28.14,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iya, Sapphire wa onnanoko da.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:28.14,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, Sapphire is a girl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.28,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella yori mo kireina onnanoko da.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.28,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She is a girl prettier than Bella.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Bella, do you still intend to keep traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but there's something I must do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay in this kingdom until the magic mirror says I'm the most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I understand completely!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to offer my assistance then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me guide you to the finest hotel in Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop, I will be staying at the House of Mirrors for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right away, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll build it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Build a mansion right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you expect me to stay in some ordinary hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the House of Mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With that girl Bella around, Sapphire's secret might get exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to act even more like a boy than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Tink, what's the best way to look like a real boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To look like a real boy? Fighting, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look who just walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cheeky brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A youngster’s come in, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent brat, I'll knock your teeth out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You cowardly fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella's watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be more over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but she's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone could get hurt here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:13:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, if I'd known you were watching, I'd have put on a bigger show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, won't you come visit my villa? You'd be most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Villa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's called the House of Mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The House of Mirrors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. I'm about to build it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,About to build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it'll be built in just five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun, I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to go back to the castle and study.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, studying doesn't suit a boy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna study!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There, all done. Now go on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you scared? And you're supposed to be a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.24,0:15:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait in the next room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Most kids would have fainted by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the maids! Dress Sapphire in a gown, put makeup on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we'll see which of us is more beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Her makeup is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A princess...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but she really is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of us is the fairer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:00.54,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:00.54,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indeed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.33,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sore wa wakarikitta koto da.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.33,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that is already quite obvious.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.17,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nan do tazunete mo kotae wa onaji da.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.17,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how many times you ask, the answer remains the same.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:09.07,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire no ho ga Bella yori mo zutto kirei da.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:09.07,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire is far prettier than Bella.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,At your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Any girl prettier than me must be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop, send Sapphire to the grave with your own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that mirror on the wall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The mansion is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella, you're awful enough to kill someone who came to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die right along with this building!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... now I can be the prettiest maiden once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's cracking...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it breaking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:40.00,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.80,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}omae wa minikui.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.80,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you are ugly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:43.50,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mo gomen da.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:43.50,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've had enough.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:47.95,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Omae no yo ni minikui musume o utsusu no wa mo gomenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:47.95,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sick of reflecting a maiden as ugly as you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.93,0:20:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:42.52,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:42.52,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Bella!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.97,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kore ga omae no sugatana no da!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.97,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is what you look like!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,, That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:49.88,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kore ga omae no honto no sugatana no da!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:49.88,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is your true form!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:57.83,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:21:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do... What should I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.12,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bella yo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.12,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Bella{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:03.57,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}utsukushi kokoro o motsu no da.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:03.57,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you must possess a beautiful heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:07.40,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Minikui kokoro o motsukara minikuku naru no da.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:07.40,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An ugly heart is what makes you ugly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:11.22,Mysterious Mirror Romaji - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire ni otoranu utsukushi kokoro o motsu no da.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:11.22,Mysterious Mirror Translation - 18 mysterious mirror,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must possess a heart just as beautiful as Sapphire's.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.69,0:23:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls love makeup, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.93,0:23:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
